    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to a house that has lots of surprises in it. This is 373 Beechmount Drive in Dundalk. It`s a three-bedroom semi, but it`s so much more.\n\nFirst, the location: Beechmount Drive is part of Cox`s Demense in Dundalk. It`s located off the Castletown Road, and it is convenient to schools, shops, local amenities and services. The house itself is situated in a quiet little cul-de-sac as part of this development just off the main thoroughfare.\n\nThis three-bedroom semi-detached offers much potential. It comes to market really demonstrating that it is a home first and foremost. Lovely living room and recently refurbished kitchen/diner downstairs at ground floor level. At first floor level, three good bedrooms and a recently refurbished bathroom. Outside, an array of buildings and outhouses. For instance, there is a utility room, and there are two or three other buildings which really give lots of scope for the next owner to use it for workspace, for storage, or for giving the kids their own sense of space outside.\n\nIt has amongst the largest gardens that I`ve ever come across in Dundalk, and this is going to really appeal to people who are into their gardening or into play space for the kids, or equally for development potential. All told, 373 Beechmount Drive is an exceptional property. It`s going to get a lot of interest. If it`s the kind of thing you`re looking for, please get in touch, but get in touch fast.\n"
      },
      {
